        "r": 532.8009000000003,
        "b": 156.07226721311486
      },
      "content": "The  'C'  and  'US'  indicators  adjacent  to  the  CSA  Mark  signify that the  product  has  been  evaluated  to  the  applicable  CSA  and ANSI/UL standards, for use in Canada and the U.S., respectively. This 'US' indicator includes products eligible to bear the 'NRTL' indicator. NRTL (i.e., National Recognized Testing Laboratory) is a designation granted by the U.S. Occupational Safety and Health Administration (OSHA) to laboratories which have been recognized to perform certification to U.S. standards."
